{
  "schema": 1,
  "comment": "Traduccion ES de High Seas Havoc (USA). Fuente de verdad unica.",
  "blocks": {
    "intro": {
      "rom_address": "0x0A2681",
      "method": "story",
      "note": "LZ intro (16 strings, 0x80=LF, 0xFF=end)",
      "messages": {
        "0": {
          "rom_offset": "0x04CC",
          "original": "EMERALDA...A LEGENDARY GEM WITH       [LF]  MAGICAL POWERS, STRONG ENOUGH TO      [LF]  CONQUER ARMIES AND TOPPLE KINGDOMS.   [LF]                                        [END]",
          "translated": ""
        },
        "1": {
          "rom_offset": "0x0570",
          "original": "  IT WAS THE EVIL PIRATE SCOUNDREL      [LF]  BERNARDO WHO FIRST RECOGNIZED         [LF]  EMERALDA'S MAGIC.                     [LF]                                        [END]",
          "translated": ""
        },
        "2": {
          "rom_offset": "0x0614",
          "original": "  AND HE SET OUT TO FIND THE SECRET     [LF]  MAP THAT LED TO EMERALDA'S            [LF]  WHEREABOUTS.                          [LF]                                        [END]",
          "translated": ""
        },
        "3": {
          "rom_offset": "0x06B8",
          "original": "  MEANWHILE, OUR HERO HAVOC WAS         [LF]  LIVING IN PEACE AND ROAMING THE SEAS  [LF]  WITH HIS SIDEKICK, TIDE, UNAWARE OF   [LF]  BERNARDO'S EVIL SCHEME.               [END]",
          "translated": ""
        },
        "4": {
          "rom_offset": "0x075C",
          "original": "  ONE DAY, THE TWO CAME ACROSS A YOUNG  [LF]  MAIDEN WASHED UP ON THE SHORE...      [LF]                                        [LF]                                        [END]",
          "translated": ""
        },
        "5": {
          "rom_offset": "0x0800",
          "original": "  \"MA'AM, ARE YOU O.K.?\"                [LF]                                        [LF]                                        [LF]                                        [END]",
          "translated": ""
        },
        "6": {
          "rom_offset": "0x08A4",
          "original": "  AFTER A WHILE, THE GIRL OPENED HER    [LF]  EYES.                                 [LF]                                        [LF]                                        [END]",
          "translated": ""
        },
        "7": {
          "rom_offset": "0x0948",
          "original": "  \"UH...OOH...MY NAME IS BRIDGET.\"      [LF]  \"THIS MAP IS VERY IMPORTANT.\"         [LF]                                        [LF]                                        [END]",
          "translated": ""
        },
        "8": {
          "rom_offset": "0x09EC",
          "original": "  \"YOU MUST PROTECT IT AND KEEP IT      [LF]  FROM BERNARDO. PLEASE HELP ME.\"       [LF]                                        [LF]                                        [END]",
          "translated": ""
        },
        "9": {
          "rom_offset": "0x0A90",
          "original": "  \"DON'T WORRY. YOU CAN COUNT ON US,    [LF]  MA'AM!\"                               [LF]                                        [LF]                                        [END]",
          "translated": ""
        },
        "10": {
          "rom_offset": "0x0B34",
          "original": "  THE TWO TOOK THE MAP AND HID IT IN A  [LF]  CAVE HIGH IN THE CLIFFS.              [LF]                                        [LF]                                        [END]",
          "translated": ""
        },
        "11": {
          "rom_offset": "0x0BD8",
          "original": "  AS THE DAYS WENT BY, BRIDGET          [LF]  SLOWLY RECOVERED, AND THE THREE       [LF]  BECAME FAST FRIENDS.                  [LF]                                        [END]",
          "translated": ""
        },
        "12": {
          "rom_offset": "0x0C7C",
          "original": "  ...THAT IS, UNTIL ONE OF BERNARDO'S   [LF]  HENCHMEN DISCOVERED THEM.             [LF]                                        [LF]                                        [END]",
          "translated": ""
        },
        "13": {
          "rom_offset": "0x0D20",
          "original": "  UNDER THE COVER OF NIGHT, HE          [LF]  KIDNAPPED BRIDGET AND TIDE, AND       [LF]  TOOK THEM AWAY TO BERNARDO'S          [LF]  HIDEAWAY.                             [END]",
          "translated": ""
        },
        "14": {
          "rom_offset": "0x0DC4",
          "original": "  IT'S UP TO HAVOC TO SAVE THEM.        [LF]                                        [LF]                                        [LF]                                        [END]",
          "translated": ""
        },
        "15": {
          "rom_offset": "0x0E68",
          "original": "  HAVOC TO THE RESCUE!                  [LF]                                        [LF]                                        [LF]                                        [END]",
          "translated": ""
        }
      }
    },
